agraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026430/extras/9cec389ba93aea19adcebdecd8b7e1ba.poster.avif?t=1764688244\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026430/extras/9cec389ba93aea19adcebdecd8b7e1ba.webm?t=1764688244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026430/extras/9cec389ba93aea19adcebdecd8b7e1ba.mp4?t=1764688244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >make strategic decisions about your players, champs, and composition,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026430/extras/9aea7188909f7d894a0c581dc01302a6.poster.avif?t=1764688244\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026430/extras/9aea7188909f7d894a0c581dc01302a6.webm?t=1764688244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026430/extras/9aea7188909f7d894a0c581dc01302a6.mp4?t=1764688244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and guide your team to victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026430/extras/ccf5fee4396d585fee13585bdcad7de7.poster.avif?t=1764688244\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026430/extras/ccf5fee4396d585fee